        "answer": {
          "short": "$181\\,440$",
          "worked": "A bracelet can be turned over, so each circular order and its reverse count once.\n$$\\begin{aligned}N&=\\frac{(10-1)!}{2}\\\\&=\\frac{9!}{2}\\\\&=181\\,440\\end{aligned}$$",
